    "49852606168": {
        "description": "Yet it's so touristy at Asakusa, Taitō-ku, it is still a great area to visit among hundreds of Tokyo neighborhood. \n\nIt's very catchy there, with some traditional spots to see like Asakusa Sensō-ji Temple, Hanayashiki amusement park, and its vast &quot;Shitamachi&quot; (down-to-earth working class neighborhood).  It was nearing new year's day so quite a few people were dressed in kimono too.  If you are just visiting Tokyo in your Japan trip, this is a must-see neighborhood for sure.  \n\n<b> TAKASPHOTO.COM \n|| <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/takataira/\">Flickr</a> || <a href=\"http://www.takasphoto.com\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">My Website</a> || <a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/takasphoto\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">Facebook</a> ||  <a href=\"https://instagram.com/takasphoto/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">Instagram</a> || <a href=\"http://www.twitter.com/takasphoto\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">Twitter</a> ||<a href=\"https://500px.com/takasphoto\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\"> 500px</a> ||\n\nThank you for viewing my photograph! </b>",
